OL,3,GNEWSAAlderney general election poll to 
OL,4,Aopen                                   
OL,6,FVoting will begin later in the 2026    
OL,7,FAlderney general election.             
OL,9,FNine candidates have been nominated to 
OL,10,Ffill five of 10 member seats.          
OL,12,FThe Island Hall and its grounds is     
OL,13,Fhousing the polling station for the    
OL,14,Felection from 09:00 to 18:30 GMT.      
OL,16,FThe candidates are Haydn Bateman,      
OL,17,FJeannie Cameron, Lin Maurice, Steve    
OL,18,FRoberts, Derwent Smithurst, Heather    
OL,19,FSyer, Ian Taylor, William Walden and   
OL,20,FSarah Woodnutt.                        
